<section class="card" id="guided-setup" aria-labelledby="guided-setup-heading">
  <h2 class="card__title" id="guided-setup-heading">Want a hand getting started? Guided setup</h2>
  <div class="content">
    <p>If you&rsquo;d rather not set up your first plan alone, I can help. I&rsquo;m Daniel Hampton, a working supply chain planner.</p>
    <ol>
      <li>You fill in a short form and send your files as CSV (exported from your own system, Excel or Google Sheets, using our templates).</li>
      <li>I check that they load and send you a plain-English list of anything to fix, within 5 business days.</li>
      <li>We have one 30&ndash;45 minute video call at a time you book. You load your files on your own PC and run your first plan while I talk you through the results and your first draft purchase order.</li>
      <li>I follow up by email within 2 business days of the call, with answers to anything left open and links to the relevant how-to videos.</li>
    </ol>
    <p><strong>US$199 one-off</strong> (A$299 including GST in Australia). 2 slots a week. When those slots are full, booking shows the next free week.</p>
    <p>Guided setup covers one stock location and one supplier per item, the same as the app. I check your files load and flag errors. I don&rsquo;t clean or rebuild your data.</p>

    <h2>Included in Guided setup</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>A file check against the 7 templates: SKU Details, Supplier Details, SKU Supplier Details, SOH (stock on hand), Open SO (open sales orders), Open Supply, and Forecast.</li>
      <li>An error list in plain English.</li>
      <li>A suggested starting point for settings: safety stock weeks, and Lot Size (Weeks Cover).</li>
      <li>The call, and the one follow-up email.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Not included in Guided setup</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>More than one location per plan, or more than one supplier per SKU. The app doesn&rsquo;t do these.</li>
      <li>Live integrations.</li>
      <li>Data cleaning beyond checking that the files load and flagging errors. You make the fixes.</li>
      <li>Building a forecast.</li>
      <li>Ongoing support beyond the call and the one follow-up email. After that, normal email support applies, with a reply within 2 business days.</li>
      <li>Calls outside the published slots.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Questions about Guided setup</h2>
    <h3>Do I need Guided setup?</h3>
    <p>No. Most people can start with the demo files and the how-to videos. Guided setup is for when you want someone to check your files and walk through your first plan with you.</p>

    <h3>What files do I send?</h3>
    <p>CSV files only, using the app&rsquo;s templates: SKU Details, Supplier Details, SKU Supplier Details, stock on hand, open sales orders, open supply and forecast. Export them from your inventory system, or save them from Excel or Google Sheets as CSV UTF-8.</p>

    <h3>What happens to my data?</h3>
    <p>I use your files only to check them and prepare for your call. They&rsquo;re kept private and deleted within 30 days of your call. When you use the app day to day, your data stays on your own PC.</p>

    <h3>When are the calls?</h3>
    <p>There are 2 slots a week, so it can suit customers in different time zones. You&rsquo;ll see the times when you book. I&rsquo;m in Brisbane, Australia (UTC+10).</p>

    <h3>Can I get more help after the call?</h3>
    <p>Yes. Normal email support continues, with a reply within 2 business days. Extra calls aren&rsquo;t part of Guided setup.</p>

    <h3>What if I change my mind?</h3>
    <p>
      Guided setup follows the same <a href="/refunds/">Refund Policy</a> as any other payment. Ask within 14 days of the Guided setup payment and you&rsquo;ll get that payment back in full. You don&rsquo;t have to give a reason. A Guided setup booked later still has its 14-day refund counted from that payment. After 14 days, that payment isn&rsquo;t refunded.
    </p>

    {%- if paddle.guidedSetupOpen %}
